        <item>
            <title>1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 07:11:51 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# TurnOver 1.0, build 9

- Writing in Mail: Up and Down now read the right line every time, including after you delete text. Before, a caret at the end of a line was read as the empty line below, and lines were skipped.
- Password safety: if a password box appears but macOS leaves the keyboard in the app behind it, TurnOver now holds your typing back and says so, instead of letting it go into your document.
- Privacy: TurnOver's logs no longer record anything you type.
]]></description>
